{"Title":"An Act relative to parental and family leave equity for members of public retirement systems","BillNumber":"H24","DocketNumber":"HD24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":null,"Name":"Massachusetts Teachers' Retirement System","Type":4,"Details":null,"ResponseDate":"2023-03-07T16:47:46.913"},"Cosponsors":[],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H24/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"So much of the recommendations of the Teachers' Retirement System (House, No. 16) as relates to parental and family leave equity for members of public retirement systems. Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. The second sentence of clause (i)of subdivision (1) of section 3 of Chapter 32 is hereby amended by adding after the word “duty” the following words:\r\n\t“or other reasons permitted under the family and medical leave laws pertaining to his position”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}